def original : Obligation := ⟨"SFT-CONSC-SUBSTRATE-INDEPENDENCE-001","Substrate independence","substrate_realization","two-realization-maps","same-structure/same-material","relation-preserving-isomorphism","complete-causal-correspondence","comparative-realization","A consciousness law is substrate-independent only across carriers with a complete relation- and causality-preserving realization map."⟩
